      "content": "it's just so much money and time to go to an urgent care for something that might just be a muscle strain. i read online that most of the time these things just resolve themselves if you keep moving slightly. if i took some high dose ibuprofen and just did some heavy stretching to try and get the blood flowing to the area, wouldn't that be better than just sitting around waiting for it to get worse? i feel like i can manage it if i just get the tension out.",
